{"strongs": "H3603", "word": "כִּכָּר", "translit": "kik.kar", "root": "ככר", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "a round", "definition": "כִּכָּר noun feminine Gen 13:10 Exod 29:32 a round : hence 1. a round district. 2. a round loaf. 3. a round weight, talent (Late Hebrew id.; loaf, weight, talent ; Aramaic כַּכְּרָא , talent ; Tel Amarna gaggaru kaspu Wkl No. 35, Rev. 14 Christian-Palestinian Aramaic , of honey- comb Schw Idioticon 46 ; on formative see Ba NB 204 ); — absolute ׳ כ Gen 13:12 +; construct כִּכַּר 1Sam 2:36 +; dual כִּכְּרַיִם כֶּסֶף 1Kgs 16:24 ; 2Kgs 5:23 , כִּכָּרָ֑יִם v 2Kgs 5:23 plural כִּכָּרִים 1Chr 22:14 (twice in verse) + 7 t. chr; construct כִּכְּרֵי 2Kgs 5:5 + 2 t. Chronicles; כִּכְּרוֺת ( loaves ) Judg 8:5 ; 1Sam 10:3 — 1. the round (or oval ) especially of the Jordan valley, כִּכַּר הַיַּרְדֵּן Gen 13:10 ; Gen 13:11 ; 1Kgs 7:46 = 2Chr 4:17 absolute הַכִּכָּר Gen 19:17 ; Gen 19:25 ; Deut 34:3 ; 2Sam 18:23 ׳ אֶרֶץ הַכּ Gen 19:28 ׳ עָרֵי הַכּ Gen 13:12 ; Gen 19:29 , see GASm G 505 Buhl G. 112 ; district of Jerusalem, ׳ הַכּ Neh 3:22 ; Neh 12:28 . 2. loaf of bread (from round shape), כִּכַּר לָ֑חֶם 1Sam 2:36 ; , compare Exod 29:23 ; Jer 37:21 ; 1Chr 16:3 כִּכְּרוֺת לֶחֶם 1Sam 10:3 ; Judg 8:5 . 3. \\ \\ a. a weight (also from shape), כִּכַּר עֹפֶרֶת Zech 5:7 a weight of lead , serving as cover of an ephah. \\ \\ b. a particularunit of weight, talent , usually of gold or silver: — זָהָבּ ׳ כ 2Sam 12:30 ; 2Kgs 9:14 + 18 t.; כֶּסֶף ׳ כ 1Kgs 20:39 ; 2Kgs 5:5 + 21 t.; but also of iron, בַּרְזֶל 1Chr 29:7 , and bronze נְחשֶׁת Exod 38:29 ; 1Chr 29:7 . — The weight of the talent was 58.944 kilograms (= 129.97 lbs.) according to older (Babylonian) standard, later 49.11 king (= 108.29 lbs.) and less; see Benz Archaeology 187 ff. 194 Now Archaeology i. 208 f. — See also שֶׁקֶל .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4211')\">BDB4211</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3603')\">H3603</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4210')\">BDB4210</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4212')\">BDB4212</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>כִּכָּר</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 13:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,10)\">Gen 13:10</ref></sup> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:32\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,32)\">Exod 29:32</ref> <highlightword>a round</highlightword> : hence <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a round district. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a round loaf. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> a round weight, talent (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.; loaf, weight, talent</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>כַּכְּרָא</bdbarc>, <placeholder2664/> <highlight>talent</highlight>; Tel Amarna <transliteration><highlight>gaggaru kaspu</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wkl')\">Wkl<sup>No. 35, Rev. 14</sup></lookup> Christian-Palestinian Aramaic <placeholder2665/>, of honey-<highlight>comb</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Schw')\">Schw<sup>Idioticon 46</sup></lookup>; on formative see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB 204</sup></lookup>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 13:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,12)\">Gen 13:12</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>כִּכַּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:36\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,36)\">1Sam 2:36</ref> +; dual <bdbheb>כִּכְּרַיִם כֶּסֶף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:24\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,24)\">1Kgs 16:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,23)\">2Kgs 5:23</ref>, <bdbheb>כִּכָּרָ֑יִם</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,23)\">2Kgs 5:23</ref> plural <bdbheb>כִּכָּרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,14)\">1Chr 22:14</ref> (twice in verse) + 7 t. chr; construct <bdbheb>כִּכְּרֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,5)\">2Kgs 5:5</ref> + 2 t. Chronicles; <bdbheb>כִּכְּרוֺת</bdbheb> (<highlight>loaves</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Judg 8:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,5)\">Judg 8:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,3)\">1Sam 10:3</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>the round</highlight> (or <highlight>oval</highlight>) especially of the Jordan valley, <bdbheb>כִּכַּר הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 13:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,10)\">Gen 13:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 13:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,11)\">Gen 13:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,46)\">1Kgs 7:46</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,17)\">2Chr 4:17</ref> absolute <bdbheb>הַכִּכָּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,17)\">Gen 19:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,25)\">Gen 19:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 34:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,34,3)\">Deut 34:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,23)\">2Sam 18:23</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶרֶץ הַכּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,28)\">Gen 19:28</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עָרֵי הַכּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 13:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,12)\">Gen 13:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,29)\">Gen 19:29</ref>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm<sup>G 505</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>G. 112</sup></lookup>; district of Jerusalem, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַכּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,22)\">Neh 3:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:28\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,28)\">Neh 12:28</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>loaf</highlight> of bread (from round shape), <bdbheb>כִּכַּר לָ֑חֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:36\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,36)\">1Sam 2:36</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/>, compare <ref ref=\"Exod 29:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,23)\">Exod 29:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 37:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,37,21)\">Jer 37:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,3)\">1Chr 16:3</ref> <bdbheb>כִּכְּרוֺת לֶחֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,3)\">1Sam 10:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,5)\">Judg 8:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>a weight</highlight> (also from shape), <bdbheb>כִּכַּר עֹפֶרֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 5:7\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(38,5,7)\">Zech 5:7</ref> <highlight>a weight of lead</highlight>, serving as cover of an ephah. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> a particularunit of weight, <highlight>talent</highlight>, usually of gold or silver: — <bdbheb>זָהָבּ</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:30\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,30)\">2Sam 12:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,14)\">2Kgs 9:14</ref> + 18 t.; <bdbheb>כֶּסֶף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:39\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,39)\">1Kgs 20:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,5)\">2Kgs 5:5</ref> + 21 t.; but also of iron, <bdbheb>בַּרְזֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,7)\">1Chr 29:7</ref>, and bronze <bdbheb>נְחשֶׁת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 38:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,29)\">Exod 38:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,7)\">1Chr 29:7</ref>. — The weight of the talent was 58.944 kilograms (= 129.97 lbs.) according to older (Babylonian) standard, later 49.11 king (= 108.29 lbs.) and less; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz<sup>Archaeology 187 ff.</sup></lookup> 194 <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now<sup>Archaeology i. 208 f.</sup></lookup> — See also <bdbheb>שֶׁקֶל</bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 13:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 13, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Exod 29:32", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 29, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Gen 13:12", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 13, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Sam 2:36", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "1Kgs 16:24", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 16, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "2Kgs 5:23", "book": "2KI", 